hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"218","Kāna an-Nabiyyu ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallam idhā atāhu al-amru yasurruhu qāla: \Al-ḥamdu lillāhi alladhī biniʿmatihi tattimuṣ-ṣāliḥāt.\"" Wa idhā atāhu al-amru yakrahu qāla: \""Al-ḥamdu lillāhi ʿalā kulli ḥāl.\"". The Prophet (peace be upon him) used to say when something pleasing happened to him: \""All praise is due to Allah"","" by whose grace all good deeds are completed.\"" And when something displeasing happened to him"","" he would say: \""All praise is due to Allah in every circumstance.\"""
"219","Qāla an-Nabiyyu ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallam: \Man ṣallā ʿalayya ṣalātan"","" ṣallā Allāhu ʿalayhi bihā ʿashrā.\"". The Prophet (peace be upon him) said: \""Whoever sends one blessing upon me"","" Allah will send ten blessings upon him in return.\"""
